<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JD Group lifts year shr and div.</title>
<headline>JD Group lifts year shr and div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     145.1	 vs 111.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)   17 making 43.0	  vs 33.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   150.12	vs 113.52</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   233.73	vs 177.12</p>
<p>    Tax			 83.61	 vs 63.60</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   89.12	 vs 72.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		  2,135.64    vs 1,884.32</p>
<p>Div payable October 16</p>
<p>on register September 13</p>
<p>Full name: JD Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders will be offered capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
